<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 3.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 3.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 03	Jan 31	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  259.380     257.120     247.020    5.00 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.800     304.350     306.830   -0.66 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.660     157.600     158.970   -0.82 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.692	46.670	47.182   -1.04 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  416.020     417.060     419.180   -0.75 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.365     140.310     141.685   -0.93 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.984	15.978	16.185   -1.24 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  212.800     211.960     212.430   -0.17 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.858	 1.861	 1.888   -1.59 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.570	 1.572	 1.581   -0.70 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  181.690     181.600     183.135   -0.79 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the January</p>
<p>02, 1997 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
